Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 It’s probably just another case of the common cold and people are just overreacting about it.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_4 I will be back shortly to give details on this “outbreak.”
Interactability_Text_Line_5 -Private Kobe

